@startuml
title Before / After Skill Comparison - 스킬 시스템 적용 전후 비교

package "Before - 적용 전" {
  class HardcodedSkill
  class CoupledTargetEffectCondition
  class NoValidation
  class NoTimeline
}

package "After - 적용 후" {
  class SkillDefinitionSO
  class EffectDefinitionSO
  class TargetingDefinitionSO
  class ConditionDefinitionSO
  class CooldownDefinitionSO
  class SkillFactory
  class SkillInstance
  class SkillEventTimeline
  class SkillValidationPanel
  class MetricsView
}

HardcodedSkill --> SkillDefinitionSO : 데이터 기반으로 전환
CoupledTargetEffectCondition --> EffectDefinitionSO : Effect 분리
CoupledTargetEffectCondition --> TargetingDefinitionSO : Targeting 분리
CoupledTargetEffectCondition --> ConditionDefinitionSO : Condition 분리
NoValidation --> SkillValidationPanel : 검증 UI 추가
NoTimeline --> SkillEventTimeline : 실행 흐름 시각화
SkillFactory --> SkillInstance : 런타임 조립
SkillInstance --> MetricsView : 실행 비용 표시

@enduml
